---
/**
 * Tufte-style numbered sidenote. Use inline, inside a paragraph, right after the phrase it annotates:
 *   ... the modal outcome<Sidenote>The bucket with the highest quoted probability.</Sidenote> is ...
 * Wide screens float it into the right margin; narrow screens show it inline under the paragraph.
 */
---
<span class="sidenote-number" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sidenote" role="note"><slot /></span>
